for gathering so many unique creatures.

257
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:45,600
Yo-ho-ho, I see you're a woman of taste.

258
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:48,940
Yeah, yeah, you like
my iron body, old hag?

259
00:21:50,700 --> 00:21:53,980
