king of the pirates?

271
00:22:32,120 --> 00:22:33,400
Don't you know me?

272
00:22:49,840 --> 00:22:51,280
RADICAL SPIRIT

273
00:22:53,740 --> 00:22:54,570
Yikes!

274
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:55,637
They're huge!

275
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:57,340
What in the world are they?

276
00:23:01,760 --> 00:23:03,300
Hey, buzz up!

277
00:23:03,820 --> 00:23:07,055
If you're gonna go wild, stay
in your own banquet hall!

278
00:23:07,820 --> 00:23:09,140
Stupid numbers!

279
00:23:16,700 --> 00:23:17,530
No!

280
00:23:17,613 --> 00:23:19,020
They're as big as those!

281
00:23:19,580 --> 00:23:20,840
They're monsters!

282
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:25,460
Eww, I'm getting mad
flashbacks from Thriller Bark.

283
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:28,917
Ma-ma-ma-ma.

284
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:30,160
Fancy that.

285
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:34,780
Those must be Caesar's failed
attempts at recreating ancient giants.

286
00:23:35,100 --> 00:23:38,276
No use to me, but it would
seem that Kaido loses them.

287
00:23:39,380 --> 00:23:40,780
How lovely.

288
00:23:43,220 --> 00:23:45,840
Is he grabbing what I think he's grabbing?

289
00:23:46,120 --> 00:23:47,600
The Brachio tank!

290
00:23:48,060 --> 00:23:49,884
Kusop and Chopper are in there!

291
00:23:50,380 --> 00:23:55,520
Hey, Monster Face, put that
down, or I'm gonna make you!

292
00:23:59,300 --> 00:24:00,260
Brady!

293
00:24:02,940 --> 00:24:03,900
Radical!

294
00:24:06,660 --> 00:24:07,620
Me!

295
00:24:12,940 --> 00:24:13,900
Talkin'!

296
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:28,900
Now that my lasers are
upgraded, I'm unstoppable.

297
00:24:29,600 --> 00:24:32,800
You should have saved that attack for me.

298
00:24:35,080 --> 00:24:37,940
It's too late now, Iron Man.

299
00:24:41,260 --> 00:24:43,020
Your hand, madam.

300
00:24:44,420 --> 00:24:46,200
Fishman Jiu-Jitsu.

301
00:24:46,660 --> 00:24:47,820
Mill floor.

302
00:24:55,600 --> 00:24:57,580
Whirlpool, shoulder throw!

303
00:25:03,880 --> 00:25:05,280
And delphidium!

304
00:25:08,140 --> 00:25:10,240
Oh, you shouldn't say!

305
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:13,205
I haven't forgotten what
you think of my footy!

306
00:25:13,380 --> 00:25:16,380
I'll kill you, too, so it'll happen!

307
00:25:20,340 --> 00:25:22,380
Ha! Good luck!

308
00:25:28,940 --> 00:25:30,280
Nice plan.

309
00:25:33,820 --> 00:25:35,349
Went better than expected.

310
00:25:35,520 --> 00:25:38,100
She'll be even angrier when she gets back.

311
00:25:39,800 --> 00:25:42,640
You are quite a remarkable woman.

312
00:25:43,320 --> 00:25:44,180
Good job!

313
00:25:44,820 --> 00:25:46,280
Thanks for the assist.

314
00:25:46,620 --> 00:25:48,385
I could have been scrap metal.

315
00:25:49,820 --> 00:25:51,761
Then I'm glad we made it in time.

316
00:25:52,580 --> 00:25:53,940
And now...

317
00:25:58,980 --> 00:26:01,280
the moment you've all been waiting for.

318
00:26:10,580 --> 00:26:13,860
Commander Chopper, got
a status report for me?

319
00:26:15,500 --> 00:26:17,860
Oh, stop! Wake up! Oh, stop!

320
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:19,417
Pull it together!

321
00:26:19,500 --> 00:26:21,217
We're getting a call from Franky!

322
00:26:21,300 --> 00:26:22,130
Come on!

323
00:26:22,220 --> 00:26:24,460
Hey, what gives? You got in there?

324
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:29,840
Yep, couldn't feel better
thanks to the Ruckio tank.

325
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:34,180
You remember our promise, right?

326
00:26:35,820 --> 00:26:37,100
Our promise?

327
00:26:37,820 --> 00:26:39,540
We were gonna combine!

328
00:26:39,960 --> 00:26:42,000
The Iron Pirate, bro! Go!

329
00:26:43,180 --> 00:26:44,720
Dakin' time, baby!

330
00:26:45,660 --> 00:26:46,490
I...

331
00:26:47,380 --> 00:26:48,210
Pirate?

332
00:26:54,260 --> 00:26:55,090
Finally!

333
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:01,680
Good, I can see the sky.

334
00:27:02,380 --> 00:27:04,800
Okay, I think I can make it up from here.

335
00:27:06,900 --> 00:27:08,160
Not so fast!

336
00:27:08,620 --> 00:27:10,837
Oh, Master Queen! Go away!

337
00:27:10,920 --> 00:27:14,120
I'm taking a break, but it's Straw Hat

338
00:27:21,140 --> 00:27:26,140
Hey, there's well look who
it is where are you headed?

339
00:27:28,500 --> 00:27:29,980
I'm coming with you

340
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:43,340
What the hell is that thing? It's huge!

341
00:27:45,080 --> 00:27:45,910
Ready?

342
00:27:48,900 --> 00:27:50,100
Kum Kum!

343
00:27:51,300 --> 00:27:52,130
Rocket!

344
00:27:55,120 --> 00:27:56,660
Good, we got this.

345
00:27:56,860 --> 00:27:58,389
You said Kaino's up there?

346
00:27:58,500 --> 00:28:02,197
Yeah, I think he started fighting
with Kinemon's group already.

347
00:28:02,280 --> 00:28:03,500
Just a little more.

348
00:28:12,320 --> 00:28:13,150
Damn!

349
00:28:13,760 --> 00:28:16,660
You ain't gone nowhere on my way!

350
00:28:19,700 --> 00:28:20,660
Give up.

351
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:22,500
I control these skies.

352
00:28:26,100 --> 00:28:29,297
We're never gonna make it with
these bastards hounding us!

353
00:28:29,380 --> 00:28:31,498
I think they'd be guarding the roof!

354
00:28:41,680 --> 00:28:42,600
Waaaaaah!

355
00:28:54,060 --> 00:28:56,540
Yeah, that's what I'm talking about!

356
00:28:57,100 --> 00:28:58,580
Let's do it!

357
00:28:59,940 --> 00:29:00,770
Huh?

358
00:29:00,980 --> 00:29:02,039
Ducking formation!

359
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:03,940
Ready to combine!

360
00:29:12,280 --> 00:29:13,960
Black Rino's standing by!

361
00:29:16,020 --> 00:29:17,840
Black your head! Activate!

362
00:29:18,340 --> 00:29:19,360
Let's do this!

363
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:22,860
Sorry, bros!

364
00:29:22,980 --> 00:29:24,500
It's only got one seat!

365
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:27,580
This is a betrayal!

366
00:29:28,780 --> 00:29:29,960
Who's that up there?

367
00:29:30,180 --> 00:29:31,340
It's Usohachi!

368
00:29:31,660 --> 00:29:32,719
It's your Purimod!

369
00:29:32,940 --> 00:29:34,116
Are you two alright?

370
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:35,917
Back to the pleasure hall.

371
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:38,137
You guys really stuck
your necks out for us.

372
00:29:38,220 --> 00:29:40,580
We really owe you one. Yeah, sure!

373
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:42,508
But you can thank us later!

374
00:29:42,780 --> 00:29:43,660
Yeah, later!

375
00:29:43,960 --> 00:29:47,940
Right now, there's a robot that
you've got to save! E-Pool!

376
00:30:04,380 --> 00:30:05,620
Iron Pirate!

377
00:30:06,780 --> 00:30:08,020
General Franky!

378
00:30:12,760 --> 00:30:18,100
Chalkie Kicker, let's rock Friggy Cage!

379
00:30:19,860 --> 00:30:21,960
Why do you have a giant robot?

380
00:30:22,560 --> 00:30:23,390
Come on!

381
00:30:30,240 --> 00:30:33,000
He took out Chalkie fast.

382
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:34,553
That thing is bad news!

383
00:30:34,980 --> 00:30:38,080
Let's move, we'll just
get stumped. Uh yeah.

384
00:30:46,480 --> 00:30:47,980
I hope he got away.

385
00:30:48,300 --> 00:30:50,712
I hate to say it, but this suit is tough.

386
00:30:54,140 --> 00:30:55,180
Oh, sorry.

387
00:30:55,820 --> 00:30:57,920
This just tickles my funny bone.

388
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:59,520
Look around us.

389
00:30:59,760 --> 00:31:03,140
We're outnumbered, enemies on every side,

390
00:31:03,460 --> 00:31:08,040
and yet, for some reason, I
feel like we can't be beat.

391
00:31:08,280 --> 00:31:09,500
You're damn right.

392
00:31:09,660 --> 00:31:10,837
I thought the same thing.

393
00:31:10,920 --> 00:31:12,020
I wonder why.

394
00:31:12,300 --> 00:31:14,300
Where does this courage come from?

395
00:31:14,420 --> 00:31:17,680
When you put it that way,
I suppose we have Mr.

396
00:31:17,840 --> 00:31:19,546
Straw Hat to thank, don't we?

397
00:31:22,500 --> 00:31:25,537
Looks like I won't be able
to jump up there after all.

398
00:31:25,620 --> 00:31:27,620
I guess I need a new plan.

399
00:31:29,140 --> 00:31:30,497
I've got your back, Captain.

400
00:31:30,580 --> 00:31:32,580
You've got me. Let's head up.

401
00:31:36,340 --> 00:31:37,817
This is a damn pain.

402
00:31:37,900 --> 00:31:39,076
Bastards were ready.

403
00:31:39,220 --> 00:31:40,837
They got the whole swarm up there.

404
00:31:40,920 --> 00:31:44,577
They'll be nothing but caterpillars,
once we tear off their wings.

405
00:31:44,660 --> 00:31:48,307
I get the sentiment, but do you
have to be so creepy about it?

406
00:31:49,600 --> 00:31:53,140
I suppose those dinosaurs are
the fabled lead performers.

407
00:31:57,200 --> 00:32:01,640
They look pretty tough, but I'm not
worried because our captain's stronger.

408
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:02,830
That's right.

409
00:32:02,913 --> 00:32:07,520
And as navigator, it's my duty to
help him get wherever he needs to go.

410
00:32:11,340 --> 00:32:13,046
Don't sweat a thing, brother!

411
00:32:13,420 --> 00:32:17,596
General Frankie's gonna clear out
those thugs before you can say super!

412
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:21,529
Everyone's ready, Captain!

413
00:32:24,240 --> 00:32:25,070
Right!

414
00:32:25,153 --> 00:32:26,300
Time for round two!

415
00:32:26,600 --> 00:32:27,560
Let's do it!

416
00:32:28,800 --> 00:32:29,630
Samurai!

417
00:32:29,713 --> 00:32:30,860
Don't give them an inch!

418
00:32:31,120 --> 00:32:32,800
We're counting on you!

419
00:32:47,800 --> 00:32:50,220
You better get ready, Kydo!

420
00:32:51,080 --> 00:32:52,880
I'm coming for you!

421
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:11,750
You
